{"ref":"BDB, נֵ֫צֶר","hw":"נֵ֫צֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נֵ֫צֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.m. sprout, shoot</strong>, in fig. uses:—<span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.1\">Is 11:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.19\">14:19</a>; (sim.); cstr. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.21\">60:21</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(נ׳ מַטָּעַי)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:7\" href=\"/Daniel.11.7\">Dn 11:7</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִנּ׳ שָׁרָשֶׁיהָ</span>; but 𝔊 Bev ‘poss.’ <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ מִשָּׁרָשֶׁיהָ</span>).","next":"BDB, נָקַב","prev":"BDB, נצר"}